][Dub]bed[ as] Experience Marik[ina], the local government has lined up numerous[ activities][ to][ celebrate] its three major[ festivals][ in] the[ last] two months[ of] the[ year]: the Sap[atos][ Festival], the Rehiyon, Rehiyon[,][ and][ the][ Christmas][ Festival].[
]The city will also commemorate the 22nd year[ since][ it][ became] a[ chart][ered] city[ on] December 8[,] 1996.
