]Over 50 manufacturers from Marik[ina] will be[ selling] their[ products][ –][ shoes], bags[,] belts,[ wallets],[ and] other accessories at[ attractive] prices[.][
]Marik[ina] is best known[ as] the[ Sh]oe Capital of the Philippines[ because][ it] was here[ where] the first pair of shoes[ was] made in[ 18][87], paving[ the] way[ for] the inception of a[ vibrant][ shoe][ industry][ known][ for][ its] high quality[ craft]smanship, durability[,] and[ comfort][.][
