> [A][th][l]one[ Community] Radio will[ be][ broadcasting] live[ for][ 4] hours[ from][ Golden][ Island][ Shopping][ Centre][ in][ Ath][l][one][,][ the][ heart][ of][ Ireland][,][ to][ Celebr][ate][ World] Radio Day[ 2019][.][ Our][ live] broadcast[ will][ begin][ at][ 12][pm][ and][ finish] at[ 4][pm][.][ The][ Theme][ of] World[ Radio][ Day][ is][ �][�][Dialogue][,][ T]olerance[ and][ Peace][�][�][.][
